  triage:description "solar production-readiness review, report 01M2CQBTXJXD07KW4YHWDT8104 (verbatim on PR #1477, comment 2026-09-13T06:30:20Z), reviewed head 48b18d48c; still present at fenix-verified current heads. docs/plans/nudge-transition-templates/design.md:289 and docs/plans/phase-bb/phase-bb-plan.md:95 (P11) and :147 all publish 'UNIQUE (team, agent, message_key, attempt)', but the shipped DDL (crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/task_store.rs:55-65) and sprint-BB.6-prompt-handoffs.md:32-49 correctly use (team, agent, message_key, kind, attempt) -- the design authority is out of sync with what actually shipped." ;
